00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:05.160
Are you sure I saw his nose move? There you are. I told you so. He's done it again.

00:40:06.170 --> 00:40:07.610
Paddington decided he was fed up.

00:40:08.200 --> 00:40:13.460
Apart from an itchy nose, he was beginning to wish he'd picked an easier pose, and he felt hungry.

00:40:14.200 --> 00:40:17.220
I'm not Oliver Cromwell about to join the Ironsides, he announced.

00:40:17.480 --> 00:40:21.980
